Customer Service Information

Orders:
Customers can check their order status using their order ID.

Returns:
Customers can return unused products within 7 days of delivery.
The product should be in its original condition.

Refunds:
Refunds are processed after the returned product has been received
and inspected.

Cancellation:
Customers can cancel an order before it has been shipped.

Delivery:
Standard delivery usually takes 3 to 5 business days.

Payment:
We accept credit cards, debit cards, UPI, and net banking.

Damaged Products:
If a customer receives a damaged product, they should contact
customer support and provide details about the issue.

Customer Support:
Customer support can help with orders, payments, delivery,
returns, refunds, cancellations, and product-related questions.
